        <UserObject id="n48" label="Controller is the grip" tooltip="PICO 4 Ultra Enterprise controller held like a pistol, gripper as barrel, rotated +35° in a printed two-part sleeve (A or B) that leaves the top-rim and pommel LEDs uncovered. LED count unverified.&#10;&#10;Source: D10 Decision; r/PicoXR video" detail="PICO 4 Ultra Enterprise controller held like a pistol, gripper as barrel, rotated +35° in a printed two-part sleeve (A or B) that leaves the top-rim and pommel LEDs uncovered. LED count unverified." source="D10 Decision; r/PicoXR video" status=""><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2c230;strokeColor=#f2c230;fontColor=#2a2410;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="228.5" y="828.0" width="192.6" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
